                    <h3>About this sanctuary</h3>
                    <p class="description-paragraph"><%= home.description || "Welcome to our private and spacious home, perfect for families, couples, business travelers, and small groups. Enjoy comfortable bedrooms, a cozy living room, fully equipped kitchen, sparkling clean bathrooms, high-speed Wi-Fi, air conditioning, and TV. Located in a peaceful neighborhood with easy access to shops, restaurants, public transport, and popular attractions." %></p>
